<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><view class="nav"><text class="back" bindtap="onBackTap">‹</text><text class="title">赛果复核</text></view><view class="score-card" wx:if="{{!denied}}"><view class="score-top"><text>{{match.divisionText}}</text><text class="status">裁判已提交 · 待复核</text></view><text class="record-no">{{match.recordNumber}}</text><view class="score-row"><text>{{match.homeName}}</text><text class="score-value">{{match.homeScore}} : {{match.awayScore}}</text><text>{{match.awayName}}</text></view><text class="venue">{{match.venueText}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="content"><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载裁判记录…</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view><view class="denied" wx:if="{{denied}}">当前工作空间无赛果复核权限</view><view wx:if="{{canReview}}"><view class="evidence"><view><text>双方阵容快照</text><text class="evidence-value">已上传</text></view><view><text>事件流水</text><text class="evidence-value">{{record.eventsText}}</text></view><view><text>裁判报告</text><text class="evidence-value">{{record.reportText}}</text></view><view><text>电子签字</text><text class="evidence-value">{{record.signatureText}}</text></view></view><view class="referee"><text>主裁判</text><text class="referee-value">{{match.refereeName}}</text><text>提交时间 {{match.submittedText}}</text></view><view class="notice">主办方不能直接修改裁判记录。如发现事件、阵容或签字有误，请退回裁判进行限定修正。</view><view class="reason"><text>退回原因（如需退回，必填）</text><textarea value="{{reason}}" bindinput="onReasonInput" maxlength="200" placeholder="请说明需要裁判修正的原因"></textarea></view><view class="actions"><button class="return" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onReturnTap">退回裁判修正</button><button class="archive" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onArchiveTap">确认归档</button></view></view></view>
</view>
